# Python bytecode from the texture painters
__pycache__/

# The Godot mall build and its lightmaps live on the godot-build branch (one commit,
# replaced on each publish), not in main's history: design/godot-build-hosting.md
prototypes/godot-mall/play/index.*
prototypes/godot-mall/project/main_*.exr
prototypes/godot-mall/project/main_*.exr.import
prototypes/godot-mall/project/main_*.lmbake
# Since Demo 16 the mall ships in two wings (design/godot-wings.md): the wing files, their
# lightmaps and the stand-in pictures live on godot-build too (play/, lightmaps/, standin/)
prototypes/godot-mall/play/w1.*
prototypes/godot-mall/play/w2.*
prototypes/godot-mall/project/wing*_night.*
prototypes/godot-mall/project/wing*_day.*
prototypes/godot-mall/project/tex/standin/*.png
prototypes/godot-mall/project/tex/standin/*.stamp
